    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-14">
            <span class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Kunjungi Kami</span>
            <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mt-2">Lokasi & Jam Operasional</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 mt-3 text-lg">Temukan kami di lokasi yang mudah dijangkau.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8 items-start">
