                <iframe 
                    src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3966.521260322283!2d106.8195613!3d-6.1944491!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x2e69f5d2e764b12d%3A0x3d2ad6e1e0e9bcc8!2sMonas!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sid!4v1712345678901!5m2!1sen!2sid" 
